 Edge Malaysia","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE80UnI1TS1nV2daQ0VwOVRUMFhWa0RGUmVENk50akp4ZmJSdVlCNnNnZDR2dEVCMDJJcXh1M2tGX2s0blJEc2FjVEZaNkRmenFy?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06"}],"events":[{"date":"2026-10-28","type":"corporate","what":"董事 RSU 股份交易","what_en":"Director RSU share dealing","ann":"11693177","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693177","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (10 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Oct (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Yinson's key recent development is a privatization proposal by a consortium of MISC, the Lim family and EPF at RM2.50 per share, with ongoing updates on the offer documents and shareholder responses. Meanwhile, the company has seen substantial shareholder interest change filings from EPF and KWAP, as well as a director's dealings outside closed period. In the latest quarter ended 31 July 2026, revenue fell year-on-year while net profit rose year-on-year.","notable_en":["A consortium comprising MISC, the Lim family and EPF proposed to privatize Yinson at RM2.50 per share.","Yinson said it has not accepted the proposed privatization scheme.","CIMB Securities advised shareholders to vote in favour of the privatization buyout."],"risks_en":["The privatization scheme still requires shareholder approval and the outcome is uncertain.","MISC shareholders have expressed displeasure at the Yinson deal, with reports saying the transaction exposes MISC shareholders to higher risk.","Substantial shareholders EPF and KWAP have made multiple interest change filings recently."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 31 July 2026, revenue was MYR 1,136 million, up 8.3% QoQ but down 16.7% YoY; net income was MYR 128 million, up 6.7% QoQ and up 26.7% YoY; net margin was 11.3% versus 11.4% in the previous quarter."}